(2689, 1774, 'Working', 155, -2, 'Hi Michael,  The leads generated from https://campaign.hertfordstresidences.com/ are being sent directly to Salesforce, without an email notification to Caroline, with Web_to_Lead_Site__c recorded as \'The Hertford Residences\'. The leads generated from https://8eatonlane.com/campaign are also being sent directly to Salesforce, with an email notification to Caroline, and Web_to_Lead_Site__c recorded as \'8 Eaton Lane\'. This arrangement will remain in place until we are confident that the issues relating to Salesforce rejections â€” due to data limits or incorrect picklist values â€” have been fully resolved. Please let me know if you have any questions.  Regards Syed   Hi Caroline,   The form was submitted via https://hertfordstresidences.com/contact, which is not our designated landing page. Our work was limited to the page available at https://campaign.hertfordstresidences.com/. Please do not hesitate to contact me if you have any questions or require further clarification.  Regards Syed', '2025-09-02', '00:30:00', 0, NULL),
