(11108, 1774, 'Working', 294, -2, 'WhatsApp flow Testing \n\nUpdate WhatsApp with flag to mark wa_initial_flow_completed as True on all 3 Branches of main flow\n\nAdd more condition in case there is no yes / no selection on whatsapp also update whatsapp completed to flow upon flow completion', '2025-10-03', '02:00:00', 0, NULL),
(11109, 1774, 'Working', 294, -2, 'Hi Hannah,  I have built the flow for the main branch along a different routes,(screenshot below) and as outlined in the attached PDF.  Possible test cases: User chooses a predefined location from Primary Residence, New/Secondary Residence, or Commercial Space. User specifies their own location. The userâ€™s interest aligns with their budget. The userâ€™s interest does not align with their budget. The userâ€™s interest aligns with their budget, but they select the â€œJust browsingâ€ option. User shows interest in visiting a showroom while on the â€œJust browsingâ€ route. User does not show interest in visiting a showroom while on the â€œJust browsingâ€ route. Along the main route of the flow, the user chooses â€œMyselfâ€ or â€œPartner/Familyâ€ as the decision maker. Along the main route of the flow, the user chooses â€œArchitect/Designerâ€ or â€œProject Managerâ€ and allows them to liaise with them for contact. Along the main route of the flow, the user chooses â€œArchitect/Designerâ€ or â€œProject Managerâ€ but does not allow us to liaise with them for contact.  Flow initiation The flow is triggered as soon as the form is submitted on the landing page at: https://previews.luux-media.com/bo/ An Excel sheet records each form submission made on the landing page. As soon as the flow begins, the user is also subscribed to WhatsApp, which can later be used for remarketing, based on Kevinâ€™s suggestion from the Smallbone flow. The CRM used here is Birdâ€™s own CRM, and the following fields are saved in Bird CRM based on possible user replies from the WhatsApp flow: Atelier Offering Selection Intended Installation Site Budget Alignment Project Start Timeline Decision Maker Showroom Visit Interest Preferred Showroom Location Appointment Preference Ambassador Liaison Consent Third-Party Contact Details WhatsApp Initial Flow Completed In addition, the landing page submission also records the following fields in the CRM, along with UTM parameters: LP â€“ Preferred Showroom Location Product Interest Landing Page Message Please feel free to ask if I have missed anything Iâ€™ve spent 25 hours on this so far, just to give you an idea of the effort involved and what might be expected.  The following items are still pending from the clientâ€™s side: Domain to host the landing page Email address to receive form submissions (which you have already followed up on) The following items are pending from the Luux side: Creating the 1-day nudge Creating the 14-day nudge Building another flow (triggered by a WhatsApp conversation being created) for cases where a user messages the WhatsApp number after the conversation window has closed, so they can be restarted at the beginning of the flow.  Once this flow has been approved, tested, and confirmed as satisfactory, we can then proceed with developing the 1-day and 14-day nudges, thereby avoiding unnecessary amendment hours on the flow that would result in multi-branch changes.  Regards Syed', '2025-10-03', '01:30:00', 0, NULL),
