(12505, 1774, 'Working', 294, 598, 'The fields created here are currently set at the company level, and my developer is encountering issues updating them using the new API key he generated (DPUBN). He mentioned that while the contact is successfully created with the custom field, we are receiving a [status] => 500 [error] => Internal Server Error when attempting to create it together with the custom fields. It seems that these fields belong to the company_contact category. Could you please delete these fields on your end so that my developer can recreate them under the 53W53 level to resolve the issue?\nAPI Fix Issue', '2025-10-09', '01:00:00', 0, NULL),
