(13304, 1774, 'Working', 294, -2, 'Hi Aidan,  Everything looks good to me. Here are the step-by-step inputs for Mike: Instagram Flow:  We can send the new fields that Mike can use on his end to create the lead in the system, combined with the reference ID as is currently being done. Previous_Charter_Experience Charter_Timeline Enquiry_On_Behalf_Of Landing Page Flow:  We will again be sending the new questions using the following keys to the CRM. We expect Mike to map and use these fields accordingly. Alternatively, Mike can share the preferred field names, which can also be applied to the above flow: Previous_Charter_Experience Charter_Timeline Enquiry_On_Behalf_Of New Contact Form Flow:  We would expect Mike to route all submissions from the Contact Form (https://www.edmiston.com/contact/) to the following webhook URL: https://capture.eu-west-1.nest.messagebird.com/webhooks/b5537644-fa06-4b85-b1d1-5dc7480ce0a9/507b2eab-5e81-4b2f-8410-7ba3f820db44 At the same time, no changes are required for the Yacht Charter Page (https://www.edmiston.com/yachts-charter/). Submissions from this page can continue to be sent to the previous webhook URL that was used earlier.   Regards Syed', '2025-10-13', '01:30:00', 0, NULL),
