(15214, 1774, 'Working', 294, -2, 'Hi   The form submissions from https://53w53.com/inquire/?utm_source=fb-Facebook_Mobile_Feed&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=LUUX&utm_content=ad1 will not submit or appear in Spark RE because the system requires certain hidden fields to be present in the form to capture UTM parameters from the URL as shown below       It also requires specific coding on your end to process the form submission and pass the data correctly to the Spark RE CRM. On our end, we have a standalone code that submits the lead directly to the Spark RE CRM. You would need to replicate this functionality on your side to ensure that the form submission, including the questions and UTM parameters, is properly passed to the CRM. The code we are using is shown below: $contactData = [     \"first_name\" => \'Luux\',     \"last_name\"  => \'Test\',     \"email\"      => \'luuxtest231025t1@gmail.com\',     \"phone\"      => \'+447500657890\',     \"website\"    => \'https://luux-media.com\',     \"custom_field_values\" => [         [\"custom_field_id\" => 22037, \"value\" => \'google\'], // UTM_Source         [\"custom_field_id\" => 22038, \"value\" => \'cpc\'], // UTM_Medium         [\"custom_field_id\" => 22039, \"value\" => \'spring_sale\'], // UTM_Campaign         [\"custom_field_id\" => 22040, \"value\" => \'instagramreel\'], // UTM_Term         [\"custom_field_id\" => 22042, \"value\" => \'whysomany\'], // UTM_Content         [\"custom_field_id\" => 22043, \"value\" => \'ABC1234XYZPQR4321\'] // GCLID     ],      \"question_answers\" => [         [\"question_id\" => \"16129\", \"answers\" => [\"Â£20â€“30M\"]], // Price Range         [\"question_id\" => \"22221\", \"answers\" => [\"Yes\"]], // Are You Represented by a Broker?         [\"question_id\" => \"24797\", \"answers\" => [\"In the next 90 days\"]] // When are you looking to complete?     ] ];  The code created UTM fields here     And  Q & A here      Regards Syed', '2025-10-23', '00:30:00', 0, NULL),
