(17964, 1774, 'Working', 294, 599, 'Complete the Multi Leg option on yacht Charter and also perform testing of entire dataset    Hi Bhargavi,  Thank you for your patience. Iâ€™ve tested all the forms on the landing page, and they are now successfully reaching Salesforce. Attached is the testing sheet, which includes the corresponding Trip Type in separate tabs and the Salesforce Lead IDs within each dataset, showing that each lead has been successfully created. Could you please confirm which field we should use to store the consent for â€œSign up for future news and updates from Jet Aviationâ€? The options are listed below: Sign_Up__c Opt_in_Status__c Newsletter_Opt_In__c Marketing_Consent__c Subscribe_to_Updates__c  Note: We have also added the Trip_Type__c field to the payload. Although it was not part of the original testing, it will now be carried over to Salesforce going forward. This was verified in one of the test submissions. Let us know your thoughts on how you would like to proceed with the migration to the Production Salesforce API.  Kind regards, Syed', '2025-11-05', '02:00:00', 0, NULL),
(17965, 1774, 'Working', 294, 599, 'Complete the Multi Leg option on yacht Charter and also perform testing of entire dataset    Hi Bhargavi,  Thank you for your patience. Iâ€™ve tested all the forms on the landing page, and they are now successfully reaching Salesforce. Attached is the testing sheet, which includes the corresponding Trip Type in separate tabs and the Salesforce Lead IDs within each dataset, showing that each lead has been successfully created. Could you please confirm which field we should use to store the consent for â€œSign up for future news and updates from Jet Aviationâ€? The options are listed below: Sign_Up__c Opt_in_Status__c Newsletter_Opt_In__c Marketing_Consent__c Subscribe_to_Updates__c  Note: We have also added the Trip_Type__c field to the payload. Although it was not part of the original testing, it will now be carried over to Salesforce going forward. This was verified in one of the test submissions. Let us know your thoughts on how you would like to proceed with the migration to the Production Salesforce API.  Kind regards, Syed', '2025-11-05', '02:00:00', 0, NULL),
