(20977, 1774, 'Working', 294, 598, 'Hi Hannah,  Once you are back, please let me know the following. Does the client want to change the URL only for https://www.cliniquelaprairie.com/clp/reservations.php to https://cliniquelaprairie.com/programs, and not for https://www.cliniquelaprairie.com/clp/reservations-fr.php? It would not be feasible to keep https://www.cliniquelaprairie.com/clp/reservations-fr.php on its own, as it is tightly coupled with the English version. We therefore proposed the following URLs instead: https://cliniquelaprairie.com/programs-en https://cliniquelaprairie.com/programs-fr Could you please confirm this? Additionally, a quick question: The URLs for https://www.cliniquelaprairie.com/clp/revitalisation-premium/ and https://www.cliniquelaprairie.com/clp/master-detox/ remain unchanged, correct? Also the previous UTM link(https://www.cliniquelaprairie.com/?utm_source=New+Landing+page&utm_medium=New+landing+page&utm_campaign=New+landing+page&utm_id=Landing+page+new+image&utm_term=brand )that was already added to the Logo needs to be removed?  Add a code to retain the utms of that page as they navigate to the main site?  This way they can see campaign traffic on the main site â€“ ideally, these persist as they navigate around the site.\n\nAdd option to carry forward UTMs to product links', '2025-11-19', '01:00:00', 0, NULL),
