(21250, 1774, 'Working', 294, 598, 'Check the HubSpot Form and send to client to add 5 hidden fields \n\nHi Guillermo,\n\nIâ€™ve checked the form and would like to request that you add the following as hidden fields, preferably using non-mandatory multiline text for each of them, please.\n\nUTM Source\n\nUTM Medium \n\nUTM_Campaign  \n\nUTM_Term  \n\nUTM_Content\n\nGclid\n\n\nIâ€™ve also checked that weâ€™re able to customise the CSS for the form. Here is a rough idea of which parts we can change on our end.\n\n \n\nRegards\nSyed', '2025-11-20', '00:30:00', 0, NULL),
(21251, 1774, 'Working', 294, 599, 'Edmiston Check Feasibility of Accumulating leads for Instagram flow \n\nWe have been sending the user-initiated non-form leads to the endpoint https://origin.edmiston.com/api/ocean/v0/post/whatsapp-lead, so they should already be in your system. You may need to add logic to group them by the custom reference ID that we are sending. The reference ID is around 75 characters long:\n\n\"reference\": \"8bfe32fde986526984a2291e2850c92eae7e2fbd40b3f29326f6b182d0d2874e_1763494332\",\n\nThe last part is the epoch time, which is always 10 digits for the foreseeable future. So, you could potentially check the full reference ID length, and if they match consistently, group them together and insert them into the system as leads.\n\nIâ€™m not sure how reliable the above logic would be, but let me know if I can help in any way to get this completed sooner.\n\nTried to work on Logs to export them but seems there is no real help here', '2025-11-20', '01:00:00', 0, NULL),
(21252, 1774, 'Working', 294, 599, 'Add some code to map on https://previews.luux-media.com/fifthavenue/  and adjust icon size \n- Enable Location name upon click \n- Remove mouse wheel scroll zoom control \n- Enable Zoom Controls with + - icons on right', '2025-11-20', '01:00:00', 0, NULL),
