(21892, 1774, 'Working', 294, 598, 'Here you go   https://previews.luux-media.com/clp-lp-2025/programs/ https://previews.luux-media.com/clp-lp-2025/programs-fr/   For  UTMs you can try the following link and try clicking on logo or Programs Learn more(En) and En savoir plus(Fr)  https://previews.luux-media.com/clp-lp-2025/programs-fr/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=spring_sale&utm_term=instagramreel&utm_content=whysomany&gclid=ABC12345&fbclid=IwZXh0bG9nLmNvbcABCD1234EfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz0123456789&fbp=fb.1.1732159824.9876543210&fbc=fb.1.1701234567890.ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP&gbraid=1234abcd5678efgh&wbraid=1234xyz56789  https://previews.luux-media.com/clp-lp-2025/programs/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=spring_sale&utm_term=instagramreel&utm_content=whysomany&gclid=ABC12345&fbclid=IwZXh0bG9nLmNvbcABCD1234EfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz0123456789&fbp=fb.1.1732159824.9876543210&fbc=fb.1.1701234567890.ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP&gbraid=1234abcd5678efgh&wbraid=1234xyz56789   The following URLs remain as is   https://previews.luux-media.com/clp-lp-2025/revitalisation-premium/', '2025-11-21', '01:00:00', 0, NULL),
