(24036, 1774, 'Working', 294, 598, 'Hi Alison and Jesper,  After running a few tests, it appears the logic is already in place. It just seems that the fields listed below arenâ€™t set as mandatory, which is causing blank values to be passed to Spark CRM.  Just a heads-up: the Marketing Source is the same as â€˜How did you hear about us?â€™  Would you mind making them mandatory, please?         Regards Syed\n\nSent this on another thread   Hi Alison and Jesper,  Hope you guys are doing well.  It appears that the following field(How did you hear about us?) is being passed as blank to Spark CRM from the website inquiry page.    The question_id can be used as 8140, and the options below are the same as on the website. Could you look into this, please?     {         \"id\": 8140,         \"allow_other_answers\": false,         \"created_at\": \"2021-03-22T19:55:34Z\",         \"position\": 4,         \"possible_answers\": [             \"Broker Direct\",             \"Mail\",             \"eBlast\",             \"Elliman.com\",             \"Friend\",             \"Google\",             \"In The News\",             \"Knight Frank\",             \"StreetEasy\",             \"Site Signage\",             \"Social Media\",             \"Other\"         ],         \"project_id\": 1727,         \"question\": \"How did you hear about us?\",         \"required\": true,         \"response_type\": \"single\",         \"updated_at\": \"2025-10-14T19:03:28Z\"     }   Regards Syed\n\nCall with David and did some tests on https://53w53.com/inquire/ and found out form submitting but submitting fields blank \n', '2025-12-05', '02:00:00', 0, NULL),
