(24316, 1774, 'Working', 294, 599, 'Hi Caroline  Michael and Mems have access to the sheet; however, for 8EL it isnâ€™t feasible to connect to an online sheet due to the nature of the lead storage. Please find attached the data dump taken from the website backend from 11 November to date.  NOTE: Itâ€™s possible that leads from the Meta Instant Form are still being passed to SF due to the nature of the connection. However, we have still recorded them on the sheet.   Leads from the landing page (HS) are not being passed to SF. We are still unsure about the website (8EL) and (HS).   Regards Syed\n\n\nHi Caroline,  Would it be possible for you to obtain the details below from your Salesforce developer, and could you also confirm whether there is any lead in SF related to â€œ8 Eaton Laneâ€ and Meta Instant Forms, based on the Online/Offline Excel sheet shared?  Token endpoint Consumer Key Consumer Secret Grant type: client_credentials OAuth scope: api API Base URL Lead creation endpoint: POST /services/data/v62.0/sobjects/Lead   This would require creating a connected app(Langding_Pages), as well as an integration user and assigning them to the app, in order to perform lead creation and to allow reading a lead by its Lead ID via SOQL. This will enable us to look up leads by either Lead ID or email so that we can update existing leads upon resubmission.   Regards Syed', '2025-12-05', '00:30:00', 0, NULL),
